<title>UK: Brit. Energy appoint Peter Warry to board.</title>
<headline>Brit. Energy appoint Peter Warry to board.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nuclear power generating company British Energy Plc said on Thursday that Peter Warry, managing director of its subsidiary Nuclear Electric Ltd, has been appointed executive director of British Energy.</p>
<p>Warry will also assume the position of chief executive of Nuclear Electric.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
